# Gitleaks false positives for Engram (Rust + GitHub Actions project)
# These are common in Rust dependency files, test fixtures, and docs.

# Generic token patterns in lockfiles and generated docs
.*Cargo.lock
.*package-lock.json
.*yarn.lock

# Test fixtures and example code
.*tests/fixtures/.*
.*examples/.*

# Markdown docs with "token" in context of AI / embeddings (very noisy)
.*\.md

# GitHub Actions token usage (legitimate)
.*\.github/workflows/.*GITHUB_TOKEN

# Common Rust crate false positives
.*registry/src/.*
